WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Weird Linshen Shumi

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,680
Compass malfunction

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,720
Brother Guo, who has lost his way towards me

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,320
There is a wood-chopping Joe in front. Go and ask about it, brother.

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:10,240
We are businessmen from other places who came to Dingbian Town to do business and got lost in the mountains.

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,560
May I ask where to go from Dingbian Town to Dingbian Town?

7
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:15,000
Just follow this road to the west and climb the mountain. Thank you bro.

8
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,190
Wearing fake clothes to pretend to be a businessman

9
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,470
I really think I am right now

10
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:23,790
If you follow that dead end, you won't be able to touch it next year.

11
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,910
Dingbian Town is a piece of tiles waiting to die.

12
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:31,460
We were tricked by that Joef

13
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,860
This is not the way to Dingbian Town at all. I got lost.

14
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,500
So what should we do now?

15
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:40,020
Is it too late to turn around and fight back to Dingbian City? It’s too late.

16
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,460
Now our army is alone in the deep

17
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,620
Seven Kingdoms

18
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,740
Entering the carriage will lead to death

19
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,620
Then where can we go, Brother Bi?

20
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,860
We can't go to Dingbian Town

21
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,060
But the end of the mountain range goes through

22
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,420
But the defense is completely empty

23
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:54,820
The seven kings are now here

24
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,580
No desperate bets, consistent march forward

25
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:58,060
Only force Yongji City, the imperial capital of the Seven Kingdoms

26
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,180
The old dynasty that copied the Seven Kings

27
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:00,820
Only then can Zhang Yuanshan be forced to retreat quickly.
